/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Seeds and saves are copied or symlinked into tests/fixtures/ by hand: they are
# large and not ours to redistribute. See crates/pahoa-pickle/tests/fixtures.rs.
#
# Ignore those artifacts specifically rather than the whole directory, so that
# small generated fixtures we *do* want committed — golden vectors, recorded
# reference outputs from the differential harness — can live alongside them.
**/tests/fixtures/*.archipelago
**/tests/fixtures/*.apsave
**/tests/fixtures/*.zip
